[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0769","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0769.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1061","title":"Microsoft Virtual Machine ActiveX 组件任意程序执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Virtual Machine（微软虚拟机）在 Internet Explorer 4.x 和 5.x 版本中存在安全绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页或发送包含恶意 Java applet 的电子邮件，诱使用户访问或打开，从而利用 com.ms.activeX.ActiveXComponent 接口创建并操控 ActiveX 控件，绕过 IE 的安全策略限制，在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台的多个 IE 版本，攻击条件低，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1061"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04.500","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-075 提供的更新，禁用 Microsoft VM 中对 ActiveX 组件的支持。彻底修复方案为卸载 Microsoft VM（MSJVM）并迁移至标准 Java 运行时环境（如 Oracle JRE）。临时缓解措施：在 Internet Explorer 中，将安全区域中的「运行 ActiveX 控件和插件」设置为禁用，同时将 com.ms.activeX.ActiveXComponent 标记为 killbit 以避免被浏览器调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-075","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5127","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20266","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4603507d019be3585b2e7bcddcb6c6f57901b490/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1061","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1061.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7x8m-frjm-r4m8/GHSA-7x8m-frjm-r4m8.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1061.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--903f9476-7fac-45dc-a345-37349051c9e1.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3563ce5ac8824b98ec39d3c626e2f6617054b9f7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0769.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0769.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0769.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0767","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0767.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1058","title":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager SNMP 服务缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP OpenView Network Node Manager (NNM) 6.1 及更早版本的 OverView5 CGI 程序中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，该漏洞源于 Java SNMP MIB Browser 对对象 ID 解析处理不当。远程攻击者可通过向 snmp.exe 服务发送特制的 SNMP 请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务，在某些条件下可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 HP OpenView NNM 6.1 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1058"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:04.140","remediation":"升级 HP OpenView Network Node Manager 至 6.2 及以上版本，该版本已修复 OverView5 CGI 中 SNMP MIB Browser Object ID 解析的缓冲区溢出问题。若无法升级，建议在防火墙或网络边界限制对 SNMP 服务（端口 161/162）和 HTTP 管理端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0274.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97004856403173&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5282","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20239","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1058","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1058.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cae595683b6fe65324ec717750e7cdca928c1db7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x8mq-wjxq-q628/GHSA-x8mq-wjxq-q628.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1058.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--130c3d18-05cf-4d85-a15d-9a23d149dad4.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/3563ce5ac8824b98ec39d3c626e2f6617054b9f7/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--130c3d18-05cf-4d85-a15d-9a23d149dad4.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0767.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0767.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0767.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0765","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0765.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1054","title":"Cisco Secure ACS for Windows NT 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco Secure ACS for Windows NT 的 CSAdmin 模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的大尺寸数据包，触发缓冲区溢出，导致拒绝服务甚至远程执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 CiscoSecure ACS Server 2.4(2) 及更早版本，对系统安全构成严重威胁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1054"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03.690","remediation":"升级 CiscoSecure ACS Server 至 2.4(3) 或更高版本，Cisco 已发布修复补丁。若无法立即升级，应在防火墙或 ACL 中限制对 CSAdmin 模块管理端口（默认 TCP 2002）的访问，仅允许可信管理地址段连接，避免暴露于不可信网络。该产品已停止维护，建议尽早迁移至 Cisco Identity Services Engine (ISE) 替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/csecureacsnt-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1705","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5272","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20235","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1054.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1054","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1054.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rhhg-gcgg-238f/GHSA-rhhg-gcgg-238f.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1054.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0ceb9171-353b-4719-919f-bc4f7320f2e7.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0765.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0764","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0764.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1053","title":"Allaire JRun JSP Servlet 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 2.3.3 服务器存在任意代码执行漏洞。远程攻击者可利用跨站脚本（XSS）攻击向目标系统注入恶意 JSP 代码，随后直接调用 com.livesoftware.jrun.plugins.JSP Servlet 编译并执行该代码，导致无需认证的远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Allaire JRun 2.3.x 版本，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1053"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03.580","remediation":"立即升级到 Allaire JRun 2.3.3 以上版本（安装 ASB00-29 安全补丁），或迁移至 Adobe ColdFusion 等受支持平台。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器配置中禁止直接访问 /servlet/ 前缀路径，并限制应用程序写入 Web 文档根目录下的文件，防止攻击者通过 XSS 注入 JSP 恶意代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236125107957&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=17969&Method=Full","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5406","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20314","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1053","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1053.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pphx-q2h9-wq89/GHSA-pphx-q2h9-wq89.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1053.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_xss.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0764.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0762","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0762.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1050","title":"Allaire JRun 3 目录泄露漏洞","description":"Allaire JRun 3.0 HTTP Servlet 服务器存在目录泄露漏洞。远程攻击者通过在 URL 请求开头添加额外的斜杠（\"/\"），可绕过访问控制直接访问 WEB-INF 目录下的敏感文件，如配置文件、类文件等。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击条件简单，可能导致服务器配置信息泄露，进一步扩大攻击面。受影响的版本为 Allaire JRun 3.0。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1050"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:03.200","remediation":"根据 Allaire 安全公告 ASB00-27 安装对应安全更新，或将 JRun 升级至 3.1 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 Web 服务器层面添加 URL 重写规则，拦截包含 //WEB-INF 的请求路径，同时配置 web.xml 中 <security-constraint> 显式禁止对 WEB-INF 目录的访问。鉴于 Allaire 已被 Adobe 收购且 JRun 产品已停止维护超过 15 年，建议将应用迁移至仍在维护的 Java Servlet 容器（如 Apache Tomcat 10.x 或 Eclipse Jetty 12.x）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97236316510117&w=2","http://www.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=17966&Method=Full","http://www.osvdb.org/500","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5407","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20313","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/820e48208a0b2ed99077ed4eeba06f43a1cc2d9b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1050","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1050.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1050.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5pj7-vqr9-qq6p/GHSA-5pj7-vqr9-qq6p.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/Allaire%20JRun%203.0%20http%20servlet%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A8%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E5%89%8D%E5%AF%BC%E6%96%9C%E6%9D%A0%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2000-1050%EF%BC%89.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1512.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/jrun_dir_listing.nasl","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-41.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0762.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0762.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0762.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0761","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0761.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1046","title":"Lotus Domino ESMTP 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino 企业服务器 5.0.2c 及更早版本的 ESMTP 服务存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未经认证的攻击者可通过向该服务发送包含超长 \"RCPT TO\"、\"SAML FROM\" 或 \"SOML FROM\" 命令的恶意 SMTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标服务崩溃造成拒绝服务，在特定条件下可执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Lotus Domino Enterprise Server 及 Mail Server 5.0.1/5.0.2/5.0.3 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1046"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:02.613","remediation":"升级 Lotus Domino 至 5.0.3 及以上版本，该版本已修复 ESMTP 服务中的多个缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，可在 SMTP 网关或防火墙上限制对 Domino 服务器 25 端口的访问，仅允许可信邮件服务器连接，并禁用不必要的 SMTP 扩展命令。对于已停服的老版本，建议迁移至更新的 IBM Domino 版本（如 9.x 或更高）以获得持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0093.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19944","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1046","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1046.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mg75-48jj-gjpc/GHSA-mg75-48jj-gjpc.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88478/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1046.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--548f4665-e32d-42ac-bc5f-29553f60bf4b.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/zephyros1603/RadiantProcessors/blob/7d44cb1cd4b9e088fbe463f1b19be50a04c2efe8/Backend/RAG/data/allitems.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0761.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0759","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0759.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1037","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 Session Agent 用户名枚举漏洞","description":"Check Point Firewall-1 会话代理组件（Session Agent）3.0 至 4.1 版本存在用户枚举漏洞。该组件在处理登录认证请求时，对无效用户名和无效密码返回不同的错误提示信息，导致远程攻击者可通过错误消息差异枚举出系统中存在的合法用户名，进而针对有效账户发起字典暴力破解攻击，获取系统访问权限。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 3.0/4.0/4.1 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1037"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01.320","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 Session Agent 3.0-4.1。升级到 Firewall-1 4.1 Service Pack 2 或更高版本（含 NG 及后续全系列），此版本已统一认证失败的错误提示信息，防止用户名枚举。如无法升级，可在防火墙上限制对 Session Agent 端口（TCP 259）的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理端连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/76389","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1662","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1037","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1037.md","https://github.com/nbrito/research/blob/f070ce78f917d962de8df74cc7a841f1cbbcfa00/cve/CVE-2000-1037/brute-fw1-agent.pl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1037.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1662/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4283810d-eab7-4400-83ed-f3e36400934e.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7hp5-rh59-f624/GHSA-7hp5-rh59-f624.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0759.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0758","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0758.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1036","title":"Extent Technologies RBS ISP 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Extent Technologies RBS ISP Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向 Image 参数发送包含 `../` 的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意敏感文件，如配置文件、密码文件等。该漏洞影响 Extent RBS ISP 2.5 版本，危害等级中等，攻击复杂度低，只需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1036"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01.183","remediation":"升级 Extent RBS ISP 至 3.0 及以上版本，对用户输入的 Image 参数做严格过滤，移除 `../` 等目录遍历字符序列。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF 规则，拦截包含 `../` 的请求。限制 Web 进程运行于低权限账号并启用 chroot 隔离，降低敏感文件泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0252.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1704","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5275","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20234","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1036","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1036.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1036.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8r4q-4hr3-rm7h/GHSA-8r4q-4hr3-rm7h.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/etc/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/LubyRuffy/plugins/blob/f873b19f27c95eaf2993ca4acde5cb7965d2ee3f/pre2008/rbs.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf7e8708729f74719033649d856e6a89cc4e555e/2000/CVE-2000-1036.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0758.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0756","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0756.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1035","title":"TYPSoft FTP Server 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"TYPSoft FTP Server 0.78 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向 FTP 服务发送超长的 USER、PASS 或 CWD 命令触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务进程崩溃进而引发拒绝服务，在特定条件下可实现任意代码执行。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响所有 0.78 及之前版本的 TYPSoft FTP Server。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1035"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:01.053","remediation":"升级 TYPSoft FTP Server 至 0.78 以上版本。由于该软件已停止维护，建议迁移至 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd 等活跃维护的 FTP 服务端。无法替换时，可在防火墙配置规则限制对 FTP 端口的访问来源 IP，并在网关层对 USER/PASS/CWD 命令长度进行限制作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96879389027478&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1690","http://www.synnergy.net/Archives/Advisories/dethy/typsoft-ftpd.txt","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1035","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1035.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j5qf-xr3x-cvpq/GHSA-j5qf-xr3x-cvpq.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ftp_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1035.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0756.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0755","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0755.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1033","title":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 暴力破解漏洞","description":"Cat Soft Serv-U FTP Server 2.5.x 版本存在暴力破解绕过漏洞。该软件的反暴力破解机制存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可先以合法用户身份（包括匿名用户）登录服务器，随后对其它用户账号实施密码暴力破解，而不会触发反暴力破解限制。此漏洞允许攻击者绕过账号锁定等保护措施，通过持续字典攻击获取其它用户的登录凭据，进而导致服务器被非授权访问，影响系统安全性。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1033"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00.790","remediation":"升级 Serv-U FTP Server 至 3.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了已登录用户可绕过反暴力破解机制的缺陷。若无法升级，建议禁用匿名登录（将匿名用户设置为不允许访问），并配置登录失败锁定策略（如 5 次失败后临时封禁 IP 15 分钟）以增强爆破防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141905","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1860","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5436","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20334","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1033","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1033.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f5ee58102af366026efb2988554e99ff8cc7a609/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9x63-cg6m-c448/GHSA-9x63-cg6m-c448.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1033.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1860/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2fc531ec-30e8-495f-ac17-fbc229210c37.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0755.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0754","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0754.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1029","title":"ISC BIND 8.1 Host命令远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 8.1 的 host 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制的 AXFR 查询请求，并返回超长响应数据触发缓冲区溢出，从而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 BIND 8.1 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1029"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00.257","remediation":"该漏洞影响 ISC BIND 8.1，官方已停止维护 BIND 8 系列，建议升级至 ISC BIND 9.3.2 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 named.conf 中使用 allow-transfer 指令限制区域传输仅对受信 DNS 服务器开放，同时禁用不必要的递归查询（设置 recursion no;）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/141660","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1887","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5462","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20374","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e8c9e9f5b27488fcb1deabf0d655d9ceb258cbfc/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1029","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1029.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6964f0764748f6ac1325f430341f6b56fd263013/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b1a41e76ddb7196d486fdca460e90fc3919fc12d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9h5w-jpxj-5jvf/GHSA-9h5w-jpxj-5jvf.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1029.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1887/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--12c6dc51-ceba-4298-996b-3c0c92443930.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/e23a9add9eb7a204c43e0b2a3d73e474ee508d84/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0754.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0753","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0753.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1028","title":"HP HP-UX cu 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.0 的 /bin/cu 程序中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 -l 命令行参数传入超长字符串触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 HP-UX 11.0 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1028"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:00.150","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 至 11.11 及以上版本，或安装 HP 安全补丁 PHCO_24446。如无法升级，执行 `chmod 755 /bin/cu` 移除 suid 权限作为临时缓解，限制本地普通用户对 cu 的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/142792","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1886","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5460","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/245","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1028","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1028.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1028.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/412d717d6f053499cbceb993220b04e36c6778d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qw49-8j6q-jw63/GHSA-qw49-8j6q-jw63.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6670f93b-0dc6-4334-a232-3b19648c636a.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1028.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0753.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0750","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0750.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1026","title":"tcpdump AFS ACL 数据包缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tcpdump 3.4 及 3.5 版本在解析 AFS ACL 数据包时存在多处缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 AFS ACL 数据包触发该漏洞，导致 tcpdump 进程崩溃或执行任意代码。该漏洞影响使用 tcpdump 3.4/3.5 版本的各类系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1026"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59.913","remediation":"升级至 tcpdump 3.6 及以上版本。FreeBSD 用户参照 SA-00:61 为系统自带的 tcpdump 打补丁，或更新至 4.1.1-STABLE/3.5.1-STABLE 之后版本。Linux 发行版用户通过包管理器更新至厂商修复版本。临时缓解措施：在不可信网络中避免以 root 运行 tcpdump 抓包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2000-q4/0681.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1870","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5480","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20337","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1026","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1026.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/00d5dd61d8384178f2ff65ceebc1e36504e0d3a4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-798q-jpvf-xqwg/GHSA-798q-jpvf-xqwg.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153000_153100.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001120a.data","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1026.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1279.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a937cff2-4864-4b52-bef6-740361ba9345.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0750.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0747","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0747.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1023","title":"Alabanza Control Panel 3.0 管理命令认证绕过漏洞","description":"Alabanza Control Panel 3.0 存在认证缺失漏洞，其 nsManager.cgi CGI 程序未对管理命令的访问进行密码验证，导致远程攻击者可直接向该 CGI 程序发送恶意请求来修改域名信息。攻击者无需任何身份凭证即可利用该漏洞，影响使用 Alabanza Control Panel 3.0 版本的服务器。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1023"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59.573","remediation":"立即联系 Alabanza 获取官方补丁，或升级至 Alabanza Control Panel 的最新安全版本。在 nsManager.cgi 中实施强制身份认证机制，限制该 CGI 仅允许授权管理员 IP 访问。如产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他仍在安全更新的托管控制面板（如 cPanel、Plesk）以消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/84766","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1710","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5284","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20238","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1023","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1023.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e669c67db66703b1cd1a71caf9906b2668093a4d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6hc7-ff75-6g3r/GHSA-6hc7-ff75-6g3r.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1023.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1710/info.html","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/mmge88/automated-security-assessment/blob/ba77b0814a1e557c943b755e3a3d8208463fcbc7/IoT_GSM/data/predicted/Electronic%20entrance%20guard.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0747.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0746","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0746.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1022","title":"Cisco Secure PIX Firewall SMTP内容过滤绕过漏洞","description":"Cisco Secure PIX 防火墙 5.2(2) 及更早版本中的邮件防护（mailguard）功能未能正确限制对 SMTP 命令的访问权限，远程攻击者可通过先发送 DATA 命令再发送受限命令的方式绕过内容过滤策略，从而执行本应被禁止的 SMTP 命令。该漏洞影响运行 4.x/5.x 系列的 Cisco PIX 防火墙设备，攻击者无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告建议用户升级至不受影响版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1022"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2000-12-11T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:59.423","remediation":"升级 Cisco PIX 防火墙至 5.2(3) 或更高版本，该版本已修复 mailguard 功能对 SMTP 命令的访问控制问题。如无法升级，可在访问控制列表 (ACL) 中限制外部发往内部 SMTP 服务器的流量，仅允许必要的 SMTP 命令通过，并禁用 DATA 命令前的未授权命令执行。同时建议替换为 Cisco ASA 系列设备以获得持续安全支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0222.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-09/0241.html","http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/PIXfirewallSMTPfilter-pub.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1698","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5277","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20231","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-1022.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a986b2f03c729ac57ae7d269a03d86211c579de0/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1022","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1022.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e669c67db66703b1cd1a71caf9906b2668093a4d/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gv87-wvw4-8qwm/GHSA-gv87-wvw4-8qwm.json","https://github.com/scipag/AttackToolKit/blob/78bf88564956b8f18a37659dc3d345093e95a136/plugins/Cisco%20PIX%20Firewall%20prior%205.2%20SMTP%20content%20filter%20HELP%20bypass.plugin","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8c0f32ff-e281-4cb4-8a10-3774459d32fd.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1022.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-1022.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0746.toml"}]